    "output": "\u2022 Print the minimum window substring. If no valid substring exists, print an empty line.",
    "constraints": "\u2022 1 \u2264 |T| \u2264 |S| \u2264 2 \u00d7 10^5 \u2022 Strings contain ASCII characters"
